  "definition": "Determinations Required for Sanctions",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-11-26",
  "historyNote": "#8857, eff 3-27-07, EXPIRED: 3-27-15 New. #12176, eff 5-17-17; ss by #13140, eff 11-26-20",
